## 🔐 **PHASE 2: AUTHENTICATION COMPREHENSIVE TESTING**

### ✅ TEST 2.1: Valid Demo Login
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, JWT token  
**Save Token for Later Tests:** `DEMO_TOKEN`

### ✅ TEST 2.2: Valid Teacher Login (Admin)
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher",
  "password": "demo123"
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, JWT token with admin role  
**Save Token for Later Tests:** `ADMIN_TOKEN`

### ❌ TEST 2.3: Invalid Login - Wrong Password
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
```
**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized

### ❌ TEST 2.4: Security Fix Verification - Invalid Username
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hacker123",
  "password": "demo123"
}
```
**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized (CRITICAL - Must be fixed!)

### ✅ TEST 2.5: User Registration
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser001",
  "email": "testuser001@example.com",
  "password": "test123456",
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User"
}
```
**Expected:** 201 Created, user created

### ✅ TEST 2.6: Get User Profile (with token)
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {DEMO_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, user profile data

### ✅ TEST 2.7: Update User Profile
```http
PUT https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {DEMO_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Updated",
  "last_name": "Name",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, updated profile

### ✅ TEST 2.8: Change Password
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {DEMO_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "demo123",
  "new_password": "newdemo123"
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, password changed

### ✅ TEST 2.9: Logout
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {DEMO_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, session terminated

### ❌ TEST 2.10: Access Profile After Logout
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {DEMO_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 401/403, access denied

