## 🛒 **PHASE 4: SHOPPING CART COMPREHENSIVE TESTING**

### 🔑 Login for Cart Tests
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}
```
**Save New Token:** `CART_TOKEN`

### ✅ TEST 4.1: View Empty Cart
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, empty cart

### ✅ TEST 4.2: Add First Product to Cart
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "movies",
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, product added

### ✅ TEST 4.3: Add Second Product to Cart
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "electronics",
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, second product added

### ✅ TEST 4.4: View Cart with Products
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, 2 products in cart

### ✅ TEST 4.5: Update Product Quantity in Cart
```http
PUT https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/update
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "movies",
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 3
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, quantity updated

### ✅ TEST 4.6: Remove Product from Cart
```http
DELETE https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/remove
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "electronics",
  "product_id": 1
}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, product removed

### ✅ TEST 4.7: Clear Entire Cart
```http
DELETE https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, cart cleared

### ❌ TEST 4.8: Add to Cart - Invalid Product
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "movies",
  "product_id": 99999,
  "quantity": 1
}
```
**Expected:** 404 Not Found, product doesn't exist

### ❌ TEST 4.9: Add to Cart - Invalid Quantity
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "movies",
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": -1
}
```
**Expected:** 400 Bad Request, invalid quantity

### ❌ TEST 4.10: Cart Access Without Auth
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/cart
```
**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized, auth required

