## 📦 **PHASE 6: ORDER MANAGEMENT**

### ✅ TEST 6.1: Create Order from Cart
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/orders/create
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipping_address": {
    "street": "123 Test Street",
    "city": "Tbilisi",
    "country": "Georgia",
    "postal_code": "0100"
  },
  "payment_method": "credit_card"
}
```
**Expected:** 201 Created, order created  
**Save Order ID:** `ORDER_ID`

### ✅ TEST 6.2: View Order History
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, list of user orders

### ✅ TEST 6.3: Get Specific Order Details
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/orders/{ORDER_ID}
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, detailed order info

### ✅ TEST 6.4: Cancel Order (if allowed)
```http
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/orders/{ORDER_ID}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 200 OK, order cancelled

