## 🚫 **PHASE 9: HTTP METHODS & SECURITY**

### ❌ TEST 9.1: Unauthorized Product Deletion
```http
DELETE https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/movies/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {CART_TOKEN}
```
**Expected:** 405 Method Not Allowed OR 403 Forbidden

### ❌ TEST 9.2: SQL Injection Attempt
```http
GET https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/movies/products/search?q=%27%3B%20DROP%20TABLE%20products%3B%20--%20
```
**Expected:** 200 OK with safe results OR 400 Bad Request

