## 📊 **ტესტირების ჩექლისტი**

### 🔴 **CRITICAL BUGS TO VERIFY:**
- [ ] Authentication bypass fix (`hacker123` + `demo123` → should return 401)
- [ ] Domain validation fix (invalid domains → should return 404)

### 🟢 **CORE FUNCTIONALITIES:**
- [ ] User Authentication (Login/Register/Logout)
- [ ] Products API (All 20 domains)
- [ ] Shopping Cart (Add/Remove/Update/Clear)
- [ ] Wishlist Management
- [ ] Order Creation & History
- [ ] Search & Filtering
- [ ] Profile Management

### 🔒 **SECURITY CHECKS:**
- [ ] XSS Prevention
- [ ] SQL Injection Protection
- [ ] Authorization Validation
- [ ] Rate Limiting
- [ ] Input Sanitization

### ⚡ **PERFORMANCE:**
- [ ] Response Times (<1-2 seconds)
- [ ] Large Dataset Handling
- [ ] Concurrent Request Support
- [ ] System Stability Under Load

---

## 🎯 **SUCCESS CRITERIA:**
✅ All valid requests return appropriate 2xx codes  
✅ All invalid requests return proper error codes  
✅ No unexpected 500 server errors  
✅ Security measures block malicious attempts  
✅ Cart operations work end-to-end  
✅ Authentication flow is secure  
✅ All 20 domains operational  
✅ API remains stable throughout testing

